    %% === MANAGER INITIALIZATION ===
    Router->>+Manager: Initialize & Process<br/>{input: "hi", token}
    Note over Manager: ✅ Manager Agent<br/>initialized successfully

    %% === ANALYZE_QUERY NODE ===
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Manager,LLM: 🔍 NODE 1: analyze_query
        
        Manager->>+Redis: Load conversation context
